# Claude Code machine-local settings — never publish (this repo is public)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Okular: only okularpartrc (durable preferences) is tracked. Guard against the
# rest ever being copied or --adopt'ed into the package, because `gpushall` runs
# `git add -A` and this remote is public:
#   okularrc  — window state plus a Recent Files list. Rewritten every session, so
#               it would churn a commit a day and collide on rebase between fedxps
#               and bigfed; it also names refereeing and teaching PDFs.
#   docdata/  — per-document bookmarks/annotations/page state, ~13MB and constantly
#               rewritten, mostly keyed to unsynced ~/Desktop/readings.
okular/okularrc
okular/docdata/
